{"id":"a58fab71e26cf742","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-local-decoder.md","title":"局部译码器的时间与成功条件","display":"df-local-decoder — 局部译码器的时间与成功条件","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-local-decoder","aliases":["28-df-local-decoder"],"display":"df-local-decoder — 局部译码器的时间与成功条件","depends_on":["[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]","[[28-df-machine-resources]]","[[28-df-error-correcting-code]]","[[28-df-oracle-tm]]"],"source_book_location":"Definition 19.16","source_printed_pages":"388","source_pdf_pages":"414","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-local-decoder"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-local-decoder</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-local-decoder — 局部译码器的时间与成功条件"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fb76a370ebde152b\" href=\"?note=fb76a370ebde152b\" title=\"28-df-error-correcting-code\">28-df-error-correcting-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3e7207510b515565\" href=\"?note=3e7207510b515565\" title=\"28-df-oracle-tm\">28-df-oracle-tm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Definition 19.16"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"388"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"414"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n:\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n:\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E=(E_m)_{m\\ge1}\">\\(E=(E_m)_{m\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_m:\\Sigma^{n(m)}\\to\\Sigma^m\">\\(E_m:\\Sigma^{n(m)}\\to\\Sigma^m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in[0,1]\">\\(\\rho\\in[0,1]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_m^\\Sigma\">\\(\\Delta_m^\\Sigma\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fb76a370ebde152b\" href=\"?note=fb76a370ebde152b\" title=\"28-df-error-correcting-code\">28-df-error-correcting-code</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OTM}\">\\(\\mathrm{OTM}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Step}_{O^B}\">\\(\\operatorname{Step}_{O^B}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3e7207510b515565\" href=\"?note=3e7207510b515565\" title=\"28-df-oracle-tm\">28-df-oracle-tm</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Conf}(M,u)\">\\(\\operatorname{Conf}(M,u)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^0_{M,u}\">\\(C^0_{M,u}\\)</span> 采用其配置及初态接口；工作带输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{out}\">\\(\\operatorname{out}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O=(M,d,q_{\\mathrm q},q_{\\mathrm y},q_{\\mathrm n})\\in\\mathrm{OTM}\">\\(O=(M,d,q_{\\mathrm q},q_{\\mathrm y},q_{\\mathrm n})\\in\\mathrm{OTM}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 为查询工作带。</li>\n<li>随机译码器候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=(O_0,O_1)\">\\(D=(O_0,O_1)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O_b=(M_b,d_b,q_{\\mathrm q,b},q_{\\mathrm y,b},q_{\\mathrm n,b})\">\\(O_b=(M_b,d_b,q_{\\mathrm q,b},q_{\\mathrm y,b},q_{\\mathrm n,b})\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(b\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>），由下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{LDM}\">\\(\\mathsf{LDM}\\)</span> 限定；其两台基础机仅普通转移表可不同，共同的状态、字母、带数、查询状态和初态分别记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q,\\Gamma,k,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\">\\(Q,\\Gamma,k,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\)</span> 及相应查询分量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(C)\">\\(q(C)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_1(C)\">\\(T_1(C)\\)</span> 是配置的状态与第一工作带投影。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(j)\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(j)\\)</span> 为自然数的无前导零二进制表示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\">\\(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(j\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\Sigma^m\">\\(y\\in\\Sigma^m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(u\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r=(r_0,r_1,\\ldots)\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(r=(r_0,r_1,\\ldots)\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 的公平乘积测度为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\\{r:(r_0,\\ldots,r_{t-1})=w\\}=2^{-t}\">\\(\\nu\\{r:(r_0,\\ldots,r_{t-1})=w\\}=2^{-t}\\)</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathbb N,w\\in\\Sigma^t\">\\(t\\in\\mathbb N,w\\in\\Sigma^t\\)</span> 成立。</li>\n<li>本节所有构造以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LocalDecoder}(D,E;\\rho)\">\\(\\operatorname{LocalDecoder}(D,E;\\rho)\\)</span> 的候选参数均限定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathsf{LDM}\">\\(D\\in\\mathsf{LDM}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle a\\rangle\">\\(\\langle a\\rangle\\)</span> 表示内容为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\Sigma\">\\(a\\in\\Sigma\\)</span> 的单比特串。时间取于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{\\mathbb N}=\\mathbb N\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\">\\(\\overline{\\mathbb N}=\\mathbb N\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\uparrow\\notin\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\uparrow\\notin\\Sigma^*\\)</span>。每个普通转移和语言预言机应答计一步；地址写入与其他带操作均在该逐步执行中计时。有限字串坐标采用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[m]\">\\([m]\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{osig}(O)\\coloneqq(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,k_M,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}},d,q_{\\mathrm q},q_{\\mathrm y},q_{\\mathrm n}),\\qquad\\mathsf{LDM}\\coloneqq\\{(O_0,O_1)\\in\\mathrm{OTM}^2:\\operatorname{osig}(O_0)=\\operatorname{osig}(O_1)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{osig}(O)\\coloneqq(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,k_M,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}},d,q_{\\mathrm q},q_{\\mathrm y},q_{\\mathrm n}),\\qquad\\mathsf{LDM}\\coloneqq\\{(O_0,O_1)\\in\\mathrm{OTM}^2:\\operatorname{osig}(O_0)=\\operatorname{osig}(O_1)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B_y\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{bin}(i):i\\in[m]\\land y_i=1\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{in}_2(m,j)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(\\operatorname{bin}(m),\\operatorname{bin}(j)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B_y\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{bin}(i):i\\in[m]\\land y_i=1\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{in}_2(m,j)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(\\operatorname{bin}(m),\\operatorname{bin}(j)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_0^{D,y}(u;r)\\coloneqq C^0_{M_0,u},\\qquad C_{t+1}^{D,y}(u;r)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}C_t^{D,y}(u;r)&amp;q(C_t^{D,y}(u;r))\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\},\\\\\\iota C&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(M_0,u)\\;\\operatorname{Step}_{O_{r_t}^{B_y}}(C_t^{D,y}(u;r),C&#39;)&amp;q(C_t^{D,y}(u;r))\\notin\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\},\\end{cases}\\quad(t\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_0^{D,y}(u;r)\\coloneqq C^0_{M_0,u},\\qquad C_{t+1}^{D,y}(u;r)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}C_t^{D,y}(u;r)&amp;q(C_t^{D,y}(u;r))\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\},\\\\\\iota C&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(M_0,u)\\;\\operatorname{Step}_{O_{r_t}^{B_y}}(C_t^{D,y}(u;r),C&#39;)&amp;q(C_t^{D,y}(u;r))\\notin\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\},\\end{cases}\\quad(t\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau_D^y(u;r)\\coloneqq\\min\\bigl(\\{t\\in\\mathbb N:q(C_t^{D,y}(u;r))\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\\}\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau_D^y(u;r)\\coloneqq\\min\\bigl(\\{t\\in\\mathbb N:q(C_t^{D,y}(u;r))\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\\}\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"o_D^y(u;r)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\operatorname{out}(T_1(C_{\\tau_D^y(u;r)}^{D,y}(u;r)))&amp;\\tau_D^y(u;r)&lt;\\infty,\\\\\\uparrow&amp;\\tau_D^y(u;r)=\\infty.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[o_D^y(u;r)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\operatorname{out}(T_1(C_{\\tau_D^y(u;r)}^{D,y}(u;r)))&amp;\\tau_D^y(u;r)&lt;\\infty,\\\\\\uparrow&amp;\\tau_D^y(u;r)=\\infty.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D^y(m,j;r)\\coloneqq o_D^y(\\operatorname{in}_2(m,j);r),\\qquad T_D^y(m,j;r)\\coloneqq\\tau_D^y(\\operatorname{in}_2(m,j);r).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D^y(m,j;r)\\coloneqq o_D^y(\\operatorname{in}_2(m,j);r),\\qquad T_D^y(m,j;r)\\coloneqq\\tau_D^y(\\operatorname{in}_2(m,j);r).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{LocalDecoder}(D,E;\\rho)\\Longleftrightarrow D\\in\\mathsf{LDM}\\land\\exists c,a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall y\\in\\Sigma^m\\;\\forall j\\in[n(m)]\\quad[&amp;\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathbb N}\\;T_D^y(m,j;r)\\le c\\lceil\\log_2(m+2)\\rceil^a\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^{n(m)}\\;(\\Delta_m^\\Sigma(y,E_m(x))&lt;\\rho\\Rightarrow\\nu\\{r:D^y(m,j;r)=\\langle x_j\\rangle\\}\\ge2/3)].\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{LocalDecoder}(D,E;\\rho)\\Longleftrightarrow D\\in\\mathsf{LDM}\\land\\exists c,a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall y\\in\\Sigma^m\\;\\forall j\\in[n(m)]\\quad[&amp;\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathbb N}\\;T_D^y(m,j;r)\\le c\\lceil\\log_2(m+2)\\rceil^a\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^{n(m)}\\;(\\Delta_m^\\Sigma(y,E_m(x))&lt;\\rho\\Rightarrow\\nu\\{r:D^y(m,j;r)=\\langle x_j\\rangle\\}\\ge2/3)].\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本次把原有随机存取约定实现为两张语言预言机转移表。对规范地址 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(i)\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(i)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_y\">\\(B_y\\)</span> 恰好返回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y_i\">\\(y_i\\)</span>；越界和非规范地址属于其补集。独立公平位逐步选择转移表，停机配置吸收，有限支撑保证停机输出存在。</p>\n<p>把原书固定码定义中隐含的渐近效率展开为统一码族版本：同一算法与同一 c,a 服务所有 m，不能逐规模另选常数。m、j 用二进制编码，避免读取一元 m 消耗线性时间。原文误把消息 x 写为 [n] 中元素；此处按码域纠正为比特串，恢复坐标 j∈[n(m)]。严格距离 &lt;ρ 保留原定义。非编码长度可用任意固定码补齐，或把 m 的全称量化限制到明确给定的长度集。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Definition 19.16；印刷页 388；PDF 页 414。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5d69b86","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-machine-resources]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-error-correcting-code","status":"resolved","id":"fb76a370ebde152b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-error-correcting-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-oracle-tm","status":"resolved","id":"3e7207510b515565","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-oracle-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-error-correcting-code","status":"resolved","id":"fb76a370ebde152b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$n:\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$E=(E_m)_{m\\ge1}$，$E_m:\\Sigma^{n(m)}\\to\\Sigma^m$，$\\rho\\in[0,1]$；$\\Delta_m^\\Sigma$ 采用 [[28-df-error-correcting-code]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-oracle-tm","status":"resolved","id":"3e7207510b515565","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{OTM}$、$\\operatorname{Step}_{O^B}$ 见 [[28-df-oracle-tm]]；$\\operatorname{Conf}(M,u)$、$C^0_{M,u}$ 采用其配置及初态接口；工作带输出 $\\operatorname{out}$ 见 [[28-df-machine-resources]]。对 $O=(M,d,q_{\\mathrm q},q_{\\mathrm y},q_{\\mathrm n})\\in\\mathrm{OTM}$，$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})$；$d$ 为查询工作带。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{OTM}$、$\\operatorname{Step}_{O^B}$ 见 [[28-df-oracle-tm]]；$\\operatorname{Conf}(M,u)$、$C^0_{M,u}$ 采用其配置及初态接口；工作带输出 $\\operatorname{out}$ 见 [[28-df-machine-resources]]。对 $O=(M,d,q_{\\mathrm q},q_{\\mathrm y},q_{\\mathrm n})\\in\\mathrm{OTM}$，$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})$；$d$ 为查询工作带。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5d69b86","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{bin}(j)$ 为自然数的无前导零二进制表示，$\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0$；$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$ 见 [[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]。$m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$j\\in\\mathbb N$，$y\\in\\Sigma^m$，$u\\in\\Sigma^*$；$r=(r_0,r_1,\\ldots)\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathbb N}$ 的公平乘积测度为 $\\nu$，即 $\\nu\\{r:(r_0,\\ldots,r_{t-1})=w\\}=2^{-t}$ 对所有 $t\\in\\mathbb N,w\\in\\Sigma^t$ 成立。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n:\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"E=(E_m)_{m\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"E_m:\\Sigma^{n(m)}\\to\\Sigma^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_m^\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OTM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Step}_{O^B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Conf}(M,u)","display":false},{"tex":"C^0_{M,u}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{out}","display":false},{"tex":"O=(M,d,q_{\\mathrm q},q_{\\mathrm y},q_{\\mathrm n})\\in\\mathrm{OTM}","display":false},{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"D=(O_0,O_1)","display":false},{"tex":"O_b=(M_b,d_b,q_{\\mathrm q,b},q_{\\mathrm y,b},q_{\\mathrm n,b})","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{LDM}","display":false},{"tex":"Q,\\Gamma,k,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}","display":false},{"tex":"q(C)","display":false},{"tex":"T_1(C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}(j)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"y\\in\\Sigma^m","display":false},{"tex":"u\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"r=(r_0,r_1,\\ldots)\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu\\{r:(r_0,\\ldots,r_{t-1})=w\\}=2^{-t}","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathbb N,w\\in\\Sigma^t","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LocalDecoder}(D,E;\\rho)","display":false},{"tex":"D\\in\\mathsf{LDM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle a\\rangle","di